Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Look And Feel|
		|testray.main.component.name|Look And Feel|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Configure Custom Styles Via Look And Feel PG
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Training|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Sign In|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Sign In|
		|portletOption|Look and Feel Configuration|
	And Portlet configure Custom Styles Via Lookandfeel PG
	And Navigator open URL
	And Portlet view Custom Styles Via Lookandfeel PG
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And Portlet view Application Decorator
		|decorator|decorate|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
		|portletOption|Look and Feel Configuration|
	And Portlet select Application Decorator
		|decorator|Borderless|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Portlet view Application Decorator
		|decorator|Borderless|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
		|portletOption|Look and Feel Configuration|
	And Portlet select Application Decorator
		|decorator|Barebone|
	And Navigator open URL
	Then Portlet view Application Decorator
		|decorator|Barebone|